                "complyadvantage-scope-starter-config-limit"
              ],
              "productId": "complyadvantage",
              "storyId": "automation-rules-engine"
            },
            "after": {
              "verdict": "none",
              "quality": 0,
              "confidence": "medium",
              "rationale": "The evidence pack documents no user-defined rule engine that fires actions on events. Webhooks (WORKFLOW_COMPLETED) are developer building blocks for building automation externally. The configurable risk-score equation and screening-list configurations are adjacent settings, not event-triggered actions. The agentic auto-escalation and auto-remediation behaviors are fixed vendor behavior, standardized and not customizable on the Starter Plan, rather than rules the user defines.",
              "evidenceIds": [],
              "productId": "complyadvantage",
              "storyId": "automation-rules-engine"
            },
            "feedback": "Fixed AI agent behavior and selecting screening lists do not establish user-defined automation rules. Apply the existing partial-credit boundary to the story itself. Credit only documented delivery of its requested capability.",
